      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 25
        }
      ],
      "en": "But you, son of man, behold, they will put ropes on you, and will bind you with them, and you will not go out among them.",
      "ko": "인자야 무리가 줄로 너를 동여매리니 네가 그들 가운데서 나오지 못할 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "c0e0d89e638b24ad861489f6204d6b4aca85e296ddc7b2128be322a15bdccab4",
      "translation_text_hash": "80bebef6f50b2a982c8f7fb93605e3379de0b897fc944a068864d243cb872e6e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "인자야 무리가 줄로 너를 동여매리니 네가 그들 가운데서 나오지 못할 것이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "80bebef6f50b2a982c8f7fb93605e3379de0b897fc944a068864d243cb872e6e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EZK:3:26",
      "sequence": 20529,
      "chapter_label": "EZK 3",
      "verse_label": "26",
      "locator": {
        "book": "EZK",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 26
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 26
        }
      ],
      "en": "I will make your tongue stick to the roof of your mouth so that you will be mute and will not be able to correct them, for they are a rebellious house.",
      "ko": "내가 네 혀로 네 입천장에 붙게 하여 너로 벙어리 되어 그들의 책망자가 되지 못하게 하리니 그들은 패역한 족속임이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "3047da9243adf5263e035525b3a59bd7846ee3b06a5aa7d2232e07f491ec44c5",
      "translation_text_hash": "e089cbf00b3b148bf6a930138fc983f59477a12c8530aadfabafb71c5a63d11c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
